<view class="container activate-container">
  <view class="hero card">
    <view class="hero-title">开通 PC 端账号</view>
    <view class="hero-subtitle">设置邮箱和密码后，就能用同一账号在电脑端继续学习。所有学习记录会自动同步。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="form-card card">
    <view class="form-item">
      <text class="label">邮箱</text>
      <input
        class="input"
        type="text"
        placeholder="例如：zhang@163.com"
        value="{{email}}"
        bindinput="onEmailInput"
        disabled="{{submitting}}"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="form-item">
      <text class="label">密码</text>
      <input
        class="input"
        password
        placeholder="至少 8 位"
        value="{{password}}"
        bindinput="onPasswordInput"
        disabled="{{submitting}}"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="form-item">
      <text class="label">确认密码</text>
      <input
        class="input"
        password
        placeholder="再输入一次"
        value="{{confirmPassword}}"
        bindinput="onConfirmInput"
        disabled="{{submitting}}"
      />
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{errorMessage}}" class="error-message">{{errorMessage}}</view>

    <button class="btn-primary activate-btn" bindtap="onSubmit" disabled="{{submitting}}">
      {{submitting ? '开通中...' : '开通'}}
    </button>

    <view class="form-tip">
      开通后：
      <text class="tip-line">· 邮箱会成为您的登录账号</text>
      <text class="tip-line">· 电脑端用该邮箱 + 密码登录</text>
      <text class="tip-line">· 小程序里的学习数据不会丢失</text>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
